1205
00:46:37,872 --> 00:46:39,002
I'll try this too.

1206
00:46:39,632 --> 00:46:41,541
The chicken jeon. Gosh, that must be good.

1207
00:46:41,542 --> 00:46:42,771
Gosh, this is insane.

1208
00:46:42,772 --> 00:46:44,441
