1209
00:46:44,442 --> 00:46:46,442
(Drooling)

1210
00:46:47,912 --> 00:46:50,842
It was chewy as it was made with starch.

1211
00:46:51,012 --> 00:46:53,381
- The cheese was savory too. - That looks good.

1212
00:46:53,382 --> 00:46:54,581
- That looks good. - Gosh.

1213
00:46:54,582 --> 00:46:56,181
It had a firm texture as it was made with chicken legs.

1214
00:46:56,182 --> 00:46:57,622
- Right. - I'm hungry.

1215
00:46:57,852 --> 00:46:59,122
