1224
00:47:25,512 --> 00:47:26,682
They went so well together.

1225
00:47:28,922 --> 00:47:30,752
(Satisfied)

1226
00:47:31,122 --> 00:47:33,151
Was that your first meal...

1227
00:47:33,152 --> 00:47:34,661
- after washing the car? - It was my first meal.

1228
00:47:34,662 --> 00:47:36,592
- That was why it was so good. - Right.

1229
00:47:37,162 --> 00:47:39,031
Along with a sweet cocktail.

1230
00:47:39,032 --> 00:47:40,691
