1256
00:48:38,322 --> 00:48:39,792
To be honest,

1257
00:48:39,852 --> 00:48:44,192
I've never been able to enjoy the summer properly this year.

1258
00:48:44,322 --> 00:48:46,792
I've never been able to go to the beach this year.

1259
00:48:46,832 --> 00:48:49,001
I expected this summer to pass by like this,

1260
00:48:49,002 --> 00:48:51,731
