1279
00:49:33,812 --> 00:49:35,581
- He's so cute! - He's so cute!

1280
00:49:35,582 --> 00:49:36,642
- That little rascal. - He's so cute.

1281
00:49:37,242 --> 00:49:40,182
No. Come this way. The road is too dangerous.

1282
00:49:40,812 --> 00:49:42,022
Come this way. There you go.

1283
00:49:43,722 --> 00:49:44,851
He's so cute.

1284
00:49:44,852 --> 00:49:46,351
